{"event":"step_update","step_update":{"conversation_id":"71c79947-b7d6-4731-bcb8-638f5e61f065","step_index":11,"state":"DONE","step_type":"tool","tool_name":"call_mcp_tool","duration_seconds":0.5367478,"tool_info":{"name":"call_mcp_tool","parameters":{"Arguments":{"action":"read","key":"c131"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"planning_context"},"output":"{\"contextSha256\":\"b1aa998f695b8077e8c81c64cd8a11ac60901e18445263902fbe970093416f83\",\"key\":\"c131\",\"path\":\"/currentDraft/groups/0/blocks/4\",\"encoding\":\"json\",\"sha256\":\"d37eecb52baf2b4ceeaf526221dcad88ef0090face4d48ce8ed2d0135d6f6aa1\",\"content\":\"{\\\"content\\\":\\\"在客户端内存运行时维护状态结构，通过代际计数、调度纪元、持久属性复制与事务快照保证单输入框拓扑保真与失败原子回滚：\\\\n1. 全局运行时状态模型（GlobalRuntimeState）：\\\\n   - activeInputNode: HTMLInputElement | null，当前 DOM 中的活跃输入节点；\\\\n   - inputGeneration: number，全局单调递增代际，初始为 1；**仅在清空事务全流程成功提交后递增**；\\\\n   - schedulerEpoch: number，防抖调度纪元，初始为 0；在 schedule、cancel 及回滚时单调自增；\\\\n   - isInitialized: boolean，AppController.init 执行成功标志。\\\\n2. 节点闭包私有模型（NodeClosurePrivateState）：\\\\n   - node, bornGeneration（不可变快照），isComposing, trustedDraft。\\\\n3. 防抖调度任务模型（DebounceTaskModel）：\\\\n   - taskEpoch, targetNode, targetGeneration, draftSnapshot（涵盖非空、空、纯空格）, timerId, delayMs。\\\\n4. 清空状态事务快照模型（ResetTransactionSnapshot）：\\\\n   - activeInputNode, inputGeneration, schedulerEpoch, hadPendingTimer, pendingTimerId, draft, displayContent, errorContent, isErrorVisible, hadErrorClass, hadAriaInvalid, parentNode, nextSibling, mountedReplacementNode。\\\\n5. 严重失败只读复制兜底模型（SevereFailureFallbackModel）：\\\\n   - fallbackContainer: HTMLTextAreaElement，初始化注入的专用只读容器；\\\\n   - readonlyDraft: string，包含换行与重复空格的原文。\\\",\\\"dependsOn\\\":[\\\"blk-tech-stack\\\"],\\\"evidenceIds\\\":[\\\"evidence-a8866f76-4ae6-466b-8fab-a69b806b7336\\\"],\\\"id\\\":\\\"blk-tech-data-model\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"data_model\\\",\\\"requirementIds\\\":[\\\"blk-feat-input-display\\\",\\\"blk-feat-reset\\\"],\\\"stage\\\":\\\"technical\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"客户端运行时数据模型与状态结构规范（代际纪元、五类持久配置、挂载替换记录与事务快照模型）\\\"}\",\"offset\":0,\"nextOffset\":null,\"totalCharacters\":1277}"}}}
